sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Cormas simulation
    participant M as FEBModel
    participant H as Households (random order)
    participant O as Outlets (random order)
    participant P as Probes
    S->>M: step (control method, once per time step t)
    M->>M: delete yesterday's trip legs (FEBTripLeg)
    M->>M: shuffle households
    loop each household h
        M->>H: h step
        Note over H: empty trashbin, eat, maybe shop<br/>(one trip leg per walk to an outlet),<br/>age food, record end of day
        H-->>O: buy food (sellCategory...) at visited outlets
    end
    M->>M: outletStockouts := countStockouts
    M->>M: shuffle outlets
    loop each outlet o
        M->>O: o step
        Note over O: empty trashbin, restock,<br/>age food, record end of day
    end
    S->>P: collect probe values for step t
    S-->>S: announce CMTimeStepEnded (dashboards refresh)
